ANNEX 7: FINDINGS FROM THE STAKEHOLDER CONSULTATIONS (MAY 7 - 10,
2012) CONSULTATIONS AT NATIONAL LEVEL (MAY 7 – 10, 2012)

As part of the preparation of the ESMF a number of consultations were
undertaken with a selected group of stakeholders in Dar to (a) familiarize the
stakeholders on the purpose and objectives of the ESMF and how it will be
used in the SAGCOT Project, and (b) to obtain feedback from stakeholders on
